## Notes
- Always consider the school level (SD/SMP/SMA) when designing features
- UI should be intuitive for all age groups
- Mobile responsiveness is crucial
- Consider offline capabilities for viewing materials
- Implement proper file upload/download handling
- Support multiple file formats for materials (PDF, DOCX, PPTX, MP4, etc)
- Untuk development, gunakan mock data yang sudah tersedia di AuthContext
- Saat implementasi API, buat service files di `src/services/` sesuai dengan struktur yang sudah ada

